OL,3,AMum and three children die in Bootle
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother and three children have died
OL,7,Fin a house fire on Merseyside.
OL,9,FSix fire engines were at the scene at
OL,10,Fthe height of the blaze at the
OL,11,Fsemi-detached property in Stone Square
OL,12,Fin Bootle, Sefton, at 03:45 BST.
OL,14,FEight firefighters searched the house
OL,15,Fwhere they discovered four people in an
OL,16,Fupstairs bedroom who were showing no
OL,17,Fsigns of life, Merseyside Fire and
OL,18,FRescue Service said.
OL,20,FAnother casualty, who was outside the
OL,21,Fproperty when crews arrived, was taken
OL,22,Fto hospital.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
